{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>34歲女星葉蒨文於TVB59周年台慶夜換上純白深V戰衣，憑藉傲人身段與修長美腿瞬間成為全場鎂光燈焦點。她與同場現身男友曾展望在紅地氈上擦出激烈火花，令現場氣氛瞬間炒熱。男方其後一個無預警舉動直接引爆網絡廣泛關注。</p>\n<h2>電視城噴水池旁葉蒨文展現極致性感</h2>\n<p>當晚盛會在電視城戶外噴水池旁舉行，葉蒨文以一身純白掛頸晚裝強勢登場。這套戰衣正面採用大膽水滴形深V鏤空剪裁，毫不吝嗇展現澎湃事業線，腰側與高領頸圈位置更綴滿奢華閃耀水鑽。裙擺側面超高開衩直達大腿根部，完美勾勒出玲瓏浮凸曲線，轉身後大露背設計配合水鑽飾邊，讓白滑玉背在夜色燈光映照下表露無遺。</p>\n<h2>男友曾展望公開力讚猶如希臘女神</h2>\n<p>面對這身震撼視覺極致打扮，情侶檔同行踏上紅地氈男友曾展望亦無法掩飾震撼心情。曾展望接受傳媒訪問時大方承認，早在化妝間已經忍不住偷望女友，更當眾公開盛讚這身造型高貴迷人，形容她猶如「希臘女神雅典娜」降臨。女方隨後亦親自於社交平台公開高清造型照，特意配以英文「Moonlight on white」呼應純白造型與優美夜景。</p>\n<h2>參與真人騷《女神配對計劃》人氣急升</h2>\n<p>現年34歲葉蒨文與男友曾展望早於去年因共同參與無綫戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃》而結緣，兩人成功配對後雙雙迎來事業高峰。女方更憑藉該節目光環與出色表現，成功勇奪「飛躍進步女藝員」殊榮。這段從螢幕走到現實戀情一直備受外界矚目，兩人頻頻以情侶檔姿態出席各大公開活動。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551840786259242_2320791396b056fc87e040.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551840786259242_2320791396b056fc87e040.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民湧入社交平台洗版激讚仙氣迫人</h2>\n<p>高清近照於網絡正式曝光後，大批網民隨即湧入留言區展開瘋狂洗版，對這身大膽破格打扮給予極高評價。大批粉絲留下心心眼表情符號，並紛紛激讚「着白色好有仙氣」以及「又靚又性感」。有群眾形容相中人「每一張都靚，白月光咁」，更有激動支持者直接留言笑言「Sophie被你電親，點算啊啊啊，太靚」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_2172068696b0117f624c80.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_2172068696b0117f624c80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841032586828_5293879136b056fcae19c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841032586828_5293879136b056fcae19c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841347677631_15129664646b056fcde67b0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841347677631_15129664646b056fcde67b0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841599513809_5933017986b056fd058f9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841599513809_5933017986b056fd058f9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841886779992_9432948746b056fd347146.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb59周年台慶 葉蒨文 前後都露（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551841886779992_9432948746b056fd347146.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>前後都露（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.193527+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1081,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:07:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:26.416279+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:26.416279+00:00","content_hash":"b98f0b0ccdba658b91b38ef2f50437c9028a6d14080828aca7125cb8cc71173f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}